          "title": "You'll want to know: اندیشہ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "اندیشہ — andeshā — \"an apprehension; a misgiving\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "اگر بارش ہوئی تو سیلاب کا اندیشہ ہے۔ agar bārish huī to sailāb kā andeshā hai. If it rains, there is a fear of floods."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "اندیشہ (andeshā) is usually traced to Persian andēsha, \"thought, anxiety\": a thought that worries."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
